      "content": "If the exhaustion is so deep that sleep doesn't offer relief, it's a sign that the struggle is too much to carry alone. When the weight feels this permanent, it's a very strong indication that you deserve immediate, compassionate support. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line or mental health professional right now; they are trained to help you navigate this overwhelming feeling. You don't have to face this crushing weight by yourself.",
      "source": "target",
