    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "helplines and doctors just feel like more things... more \"tasks\" to manage. another thing to be exhausted by. it's just a loop of trying to fix something that feels fundamentally broken. it feels like there's no version of this where i'm not just constantly struggling to exist. it's like i'm just waiting for the noise to finally shut off.",
