      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The thought of more tasks is exhausting when you're already running on fumes, and that feeling of being fundamentally broken is a very painful place to be. If the idea of a \"fix\" feels too heavy, maybe the only real relief is just stopping the fight for a moment. You deserve a break from the constant effort, and sometimes the most immediate relief comes from letting go of the need to \"fix\" anything right now.",
